<section class="section" id="process" aria-labelledby="process-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head section-head--center reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow__dot"></span>How we work</span>
      <h2 id="process-heading">Audit, architect, build, hand over</h2>
      <p>Every engagement runs the same four stages. You know what happens next, what you are approving, and when you get it.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="timeline" role="list">
      <li class="step reveal"><div class="step__num">01</div><h3>Audit</h3><p>We go through your portal, data model, integrations, and sales process. You get a written picture of what is working, what is broken, and what is costing you time.</p></li>
      <li class="step reveal" style="--d:1"><div class="step__num">02</div><h3>Architecture</h3><p>We design the data model, pipelines, lifecycle stages, permissions, and integration map before touching anything, and walk you through it for approval.</p></li>
      <li class="step reveal" style="--d:2"><div class="step__num">03</div><h3>Build</h3><p>We build and test in a sandbox first, then deploy. Workflows, custom code, integrations, dashboards, and safeguards.</p></li>
      <li class="step reveal" style="--d:3"><div class="step__num">04</div><h3>Handover</h3><p>Live training and written SOPs so your team owns the system. Documentation covers the data model, automation logic, integration map, and permissions.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

